FortiGateSSHPassword.dat
========================

Production location:

D:\FortiGateGPS\FortiGateSSHPassword.dat

This file contains the Windows DPAPI-protected password used by the OpenSSH AskPass process.

The production encrypted file is intentionally not stored in source control because the encrypted value is tied to the Windows security context used when it is created.

For testing or deployment, create FortiGateSSHPassword.dat locally using the password assigned to the FortiGate "gps-automation" administrator.

The gps-automation password may be changed or reset as required for Fortinet Support testing.
